
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AFAQ iGAMING</title>
<style>
:root {
  --navy:#123c49;
  --navy2:#092a35;
  --gold:#d8b45c;
  --text:#f5e9c8;
}
* {box-sizing:border-box}
body {
  margin:0;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  background:var(--navy2);
  color:var(--text);
}
header {
  padding:22px;
  background:var(--navy);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--gold);
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
}
.logo {font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:var(--gold)}
nav a {
  color:var(--text);
  text-decoration:none;
  margin:0 8px;
  font-size:13px;
}
.hero {
  text-align:center;
  padding:75px 20px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#123c49,#071f29);
}
.hero h1 {
  color:var(--gold);
  font-size:38px;
}
.hero p {line-height:1.8;color:#eee0bd}
.btn {
  display:inline-block;
  padding:13px 24px;
  background:var(--gold);
  color:#092a35;
  text-decoration:none;
  border-radius:6px;
  font-weight:bold;
  margin-top:15px;
}
section {padding:35px 20px}
h2 {color:var(--gold);text-align:center}
.grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));
  gap:16px;
  max-width:1050px;
  margin:25px auto;
}
.card {
  background:var(--navy);
  border:1px solid #9c8148;
  padding:23px;
  border-radius:10px;
}
.card h3 {color:var(--gold)}
.card p {line-height:1.6;color:#e6dcc4}
footer {
  padding:25px;
  text-align:center;
  border-top:1px solid var(--gold);
  color:#d8b45c;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">AFAQ iGAMING</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#technology">Technology</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>GLOBAL GAMING TECHNOLOGY</h1>
  <p>
    Advanced B2B iGaming Software Solutions<br>
    Sportsbook Technology | Casino Integration | API
  </p>
  <a href="#services" class="btn">Explore Solutions</a>
</div>

<section id="services">
  <h2>OUR SOLUTIONS</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Gaming Platform</h3>
      <p>Custom gaming platform development and management systems.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Sportsbook API</h3>
      <p>Sports data and licensed sportsbook provider integration.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Casino Integration</h3>
      <p>Third-party gaming provider integration for licensed operators.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>API Center</h3>
      <p>Centralized API connectivity and integration management.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Partner Management</h3>
      <p>Business partners, providers and client administration.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Analytics</h3>
      <p>Business reports, performance monitoring and analytics.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="technology">
  <h2>OUR TECHNOLOGY</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Secure Architecture</h3>
      <p>Modern, scalable and modular software infrastructure.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>API Infrastructure</h3>
      <p>REST APIs and WebSocket integration architecture.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <h2>BUSINESS PARTNERSHIPS</h2>
  <p style="text-align:center">
    Technology solutions for licensed gaming operators worldwide.
  </p>
</section>

<footer>
  AFAQ iGAMING © 2026<br>
  GLOBAL GAMING TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS
</footer>

</body>
</html>
